  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/we_started_with_marriage)  \nA secret marriage with a popular idol!\n\nTae-eun, who took a leave of absence from college to take care of her mother, who was injured while working, and worked at the same time, goes to Jongtaek's memorial service and meets her grandson Ryu Jin.  \nAlthough they were entangled in bad things and were offended by each other, Ryu Jin's grandmother, who saw Tae-eun well, suggests Tae-eun to marry Ryu Jin.  \nTae-eun starts a secret marriage for family circumstances, and Ryu-jin starts a secret marriage to continue her idol...!",
